<section class="section"><div class="container"><h1 class="title">Data & privacy on this instance</h1><p>The host stores accounts, password hashes, quizzes, images, results, preferences and AI usage in its database and local storage. Sessions use an essential cookie; your browser also remembers display preferences.</p><p class="mt-4">Study text and editing instructions are sent to the configured AI provider when you request generation or an AI edit. Your provider key is encrypted in the database. Public quizzes can be read by anyone with access to this instance. Set visibility to private to restrict a quiz to its author and administrators.</p><p class="mt-4">Link import fetches the URL from this server. Third-party fonts and interface libraries load from their CDNs. WiseSloth.open does not include advertising, analytics, CAPTCHA, or fingerprint collection.</p><p class="mt-4">Contact this instance's host about retention, backups or deletion. The host can access data and server-side keys. Provider privacy terms apply to AI requests.</p></div></section>
